                    <ol className="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2 font-bold text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
                      <li>Buka <a href="https://postimages.org/" target="_blank" className="underline text-primary">PostImages.org</a></li>
                      <li>Upload foto Anda, lalu pilih <b>Direct Link</b>.</li>
                      <li>Tempel link tersebut ke kotak input manual di bawah.</li>
                    </ol>
                  </div>
                  <div className="space-y-3 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-black/20 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800">
